       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. USAGE-TEST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-VAR1 PIC X(10) USAGE IS DISPLAY VALUE "HELLO".
       01 WS-VAR2 PIC 9(5) USAGE IS COMP VALUE 12345.
       01 WS-VAR3 PIC X(10) USAGE DISPLAY VALUE "WORLD".
       01 WS-VAR4 PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP VALUE 67890.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY WS-VAR1.
           DISPLAY WS-VAR2.
           DISPLAY WS-VAR3.
           DISPLAY WS-VAR4.
           STOP RUN.